{"id":"628701","name":"凉拌莴苣丝","author":"红袖添香v","authorId":"11598100","desc":"","cover":"images/628701/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"莴苣","amount":"3个半根"}],"sub":[{"name":"盐","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"干红辣椒","amount":"4个"},{"name":"蒜","amount":"1头"},{"name":"白糖","amount":"1匙"},{"name":"白芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"准备好食材和调料。","img":"images/628701/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"莴苣去皮清洗干净。","img":"images/628701/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"我脚切成细丝，放入碗中，再撒入盐腌制半小时。","img":"images/628701/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"把莴苣丝腌制出水分。","img":"images/628701/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"放入清水清洗掉盐分。","img":"images/628701/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用手攥出水分。","img":"images/628701/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"干红辣椒和蒜都切碎。","img":"images/628701/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"把干红辣椒、蒜、白芝麻放在莴苣上。","img":"images/628701/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"锅中倒入花生油。","img":"images/628701/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"熬至油冒烟后，把热油浇到碗中。","img":"images/628701/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"再倒入生抽。","img":"images/628701/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"撒入白糖。","img":"images/628701/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"倒入白醋。","img":"images/628701/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"再倒入适量香油。","img":"images/628701/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"充分搅拌后就可以装盘了，凉拌莴苣丝，开胃下饭非常爽口。","img":"images/628701/step_15.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}